              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c039b264-2955-4732-b5ed-08e6e70496bd</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">POLLUTANT CANYON
Street-canyon dispersion. Units: METERS.
Built on the shipped BoxDomain workflow.

GEOMETRY, from TestPollutantCanyonContainerE2E:
two building blocks (40,30,0)-(80,50,20) and
(40,70,0)-(80,90,20), leaving a canyon along X
between y=50 and y=70. Base cell size 5 m, to
match the fixture's 120 x 120 x 40 m blockMesh
over 24 x 24 x 8 cells.

POLLUTANT SOURCE volume (40,52,0)-(55,68,10),
species "exhaust", 0.01 kg/s. The volume is
deliberately many cells across - a box near the
cell size is exactly how a topoSet zone comes
out empty.

PROBE RAKE on the canyon centreline at
pedestrian height, wind along +X:
  (25, 60, 2)   upwind   - must stay near 0
  (47.5, 60, 2) in-source - carries the emission
  (75, 60, 2)   downwind - diluted, above upwind
Probe Field is set to "exhaust", so it reads the
tracer concentration (kg/m3), not velocity.

Run Settings Iterations = 80, the fixture's
short-run count.

PRUNED from BoxDomain: the sample Tree branch,
the sample building geometry, the 6208-point
sample probe cloud, and the Wind Field Viewer /
Wind Legend / Streamlines branch that read it.
That cloud is another site's, and it shipped
with a stale cached result (341 velocities for
6208 points) that showed as an orange component.

Action toggles ship OFF. Order: Outdoor Case &gt;
Write, Run &gt; Mesh, Run &gt; Create Zones,
Run &gt; Simulate.</item>
                  </items>
